# Internal working docs (planning, process, design notes).
# Kept locally, not published. Public docs stay tracked:
# README.md, ARCHITECTURE.md, API_REFERENCE.md, EXAMPLES.md
/PRODUCT.md
/prd.md
/flow.md
/decision.md
/tests.md
/not-removed.md
