/.vscode

# Impeccable design-skill state (hook caches, snapshots). Local tooling,
# never published. Unanchored so it matches at any depth - these dirs get
# created wherever the skill runs (repo root, extension/, landing/, ...).
.impeccable/

# Single-file inlined build of the landing page, generated only to preview or
# publish it. The real site is landing/index.html plus assets/; this is a
# 250 KB duplicate of it and must never be what GitHub Pages serves.
landing/_preview.html

# NOTE: extension/media/icon.png is generated (scripts/build-icon.js) but is
# deliberately TRACKED - `vsce package` reads it, so a clean checkout must
# have it without running a build step first.
